<mvc:View xmlns:macros="sap.fe.macros" 
    xmlns:smartmultiedit="sap.ui.comp.smartmultiedit" 
    xmlns:layout="sap.ui.layout" 
    controllerName="ui5.anime.app.anime.CadastroEditarAnime"
    displayBlock="true"
    xmlns="sap.m"
    xmlns:f= "sap.f"
    xmlns:mvc="sap.ui.core.mvc"
    xmlns:core="sap.ui.core"
    xmlns:sf="sap.ui.comp.smartfield"
    xmlns:si="sap.m.StepInput"
    xmlns:l = "sap.m.List">
    <Page
        id = "pagina" 
        title="{i18n>TituloPaginaCadastroAnime}" 
        class="sapUiResponsiveContentPadding"
        showNavButton="true"
        navButtonPress="aoClicarEmVoltarParaListaAnime"
        titleAlignment="Center"
        bindingContexts="onInit"
    >
        <content>
            <layout:VerticalLayout width="100%" id = "layoutTela">
                <Label id= "labelId" text="ID:" visible="false" class = "sapUiTinyMarginTopBottom"></Label>
                <Input id="inputId" editable="false" visible="false" width="30%" value = '{path: "anime>/id"}'></Input>
                <Label text="{i18n>labelNome}"  class = "sapUiTinyMarginTopBottom"></Label>
                <Input placeholder="{i18n>placeholderNome}" width="25%" maxLength="40" id='inputNome' liveChange="aoDigitarNoInput" value = "{path:'anime>/nome'}"></Input>
                <Label text="{i18n>labelSinopse}" class = "sapUiTinyMarginTopBottom"></Label>
                <TextArea width="50%" maxLength="400" placeholder="{i18n>placeholderSinopse}" height="100px" id="inputSinopse" liveChange="aoDigitarNoInput" value = "{path:'anime>/sinopse'}"></TextArea>
                <Label text="{i18n>labelNota}" class = "sapUiTinyMarginTopBottom"></Label>
                <StepInput value = "{path:'anime>/nota'}" min= "1" max = "10" step = "0.1" displayValuePrecision="1" width="3%" id="inputNota" ></StepInput>
                <Label text="{i18n>labelGeneros}"  class = "sapUiTinyMarginTopBottom"></Label>
                <Panel height="230px" width="25%">
                    <List
                    id ="listaDeGeneros"
                    items= "{path: 'generos>/'}"
                    mode="MultiSelect"
                    includeItemInSelection="true"
                    >
                        <CustomListItem >
                        <Label text="{path: 'generos>nome'}"></Label>
                        <Label text="{path: 'generos>id'}" visible="false"></Label>
                        </CustomListItem> 
                </List>
                </Panel>
                <Label text="{i18n>labelDataLancamento}" class = "sapUiTinyMarginTopBottom"></Label>
                <DatePicker
                    id="inputDataLancamento"
                    displayFormat="short"
                    valueFormat='yyyy-MM-ddT00:00:00'
                    value = "{path:'anime>/dataLancamento'}"
                    width="12%"               
                    class= "filtroDataAnime"
                    liveChange="aoDigitarNoInput"
                    />
                <Label text="{i18n>labelStatusExibicao}" class = "sapUiTinyMarginTopBottom"></Label>
                <Select
                    id = "inputStatus"
                    forceSelection="false"
                    selectedKey="1"
                    items="{
                        path: 'status>/'
                    }">
                    <core:Item key="{status>id}" text="{status>descricao}" />
                </Select>
                <Button id="btnSalvar" text= "{i18n>btnSalvar}" width="5%" press= "aoClicarEmSalvar" class = "sapMBtnInner"></Button>
            </layout:VerticalLayout>
        </content>
    </Page>
</mvc:View>